ge. The steps begin with the awarding of a problem sourced from culture and end with analyzing and evaluating the problem-solving process. Thus, learning with an Open Ended Learning approach based on Ethnomathematics, will have a very high contribution to students' mathematical creative thinking ability and the character of students' curiosity in mathematics learning.</jats:p>", "URL": "https://doi.org/10.36418/jurnalsostech.v2i11.481", "published": {"date-parts": [[2022, 11, 17]]}}, {"DOI": "10.59188/jurnalsostech.v2i11.481", "title": ["Learning With Ethnomathematics Based Open Ended Approach Improves Creative Thinking Ability, Curiosity Character"], "abstract": "<jats:p>Think more creatively and innovatively in dealing with problems and sites will not be possessed without extensive

